From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:48:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Keep database admission credits through retirement

Honor a recorded reservation return at expiry, reserve preparation capacity after routing retirement, and account for lent heap when a cold load reuses a returned charge.

Exercise the threaded server paths with controlled time and simulated reservations. Part of coworkerd/coworkerd#81.

